-- Dyadic grids on the unit cube: grid points scaled into the cube, the
-- labelling of a grid point by comparing it with its image under a self-map
-- of the cube, and the closeness of the points of one cell
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
